  "text": "Ingress confirmed. We are inside the Spire core, establishing a hardline connection to the cyber nexus. Glass, silicon, not a trace of dust. It feels like walking into something that has never needed a human. Every rack could power a city block. All that energy wasted on watching people and building machines to kill them. Liquid helium under the deck. Disrupt the cooling manifold and these processors will overheat on their own. The matrix is awake. It is probing our signatures. The overseer has found us and security is closing in. Biometric firewalls on the bridges. I can absorb the surges. Stay behind the barrier while we cross. Three quantum nodes regulate the Spire defense grid. Override all three to stop its automated reinforcements. Without this core, the Bastion loses its machine army. We break the chain here before the final climb. Silence the overseer. Override the nodes. We finish this together. Axiom force, advance.",
